I made this for my landscaping business to list each customer with their order count. Proud of the subquery!
SELECT name, (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders WHERE orders.cust_id = customers.id) FROM customers WHERE name LIKE '%a%' OR name LIKE '%e%' OR name LIKE '%i%';
